#
# The defect classes this distribution DECLARES (mtools:W629), planted one at a time by the
# `:mutants` runner: <module>|<name>|<pattern>|<replacement>|<scope>. A line that stops matching is a
# STALE declaration and fails the grid as UNAPPLIED.

# W620: a tool_reference whose name is missing or not a string stays UNDECODED and carries the whole
# JSON, never guessed; without the type check a numeric name decodes as text and is read as a name.
src/mikemol/transcriptstruct/blocks.py|reference-name-type-unchecked|if known and isinstance\(text, str\):|if known:|def=_sub_block
